      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BROOKLYN DAN (2) won a Victoria Derby heat here two back then led in the final but couldn't see it out and finished midfield. Freshened since and has the speed to be prominent from the low draw so can return to the winners' list. SEATHESTARS (1) found winning form at this circuit and distance two back then stuck on to place behind a handy one over a shorter trip last time. Led in both of those so has the speed to take advantage of the ace draw. SCHWARZ (6) was solid when fourth here most recently and is suited up to a distance where he owns a good record. ATA RANGI (9) draws on the back row but there was merit in his last-start fourth in the SA Cup and he placed in a heat of that series prior.",
